
# 🍽️ AI Recipe & Nutrition Assistant
### Intelligent Recipe Recommendation & Nutrition Analysis using NitroStack MCP
### 🚀 AI-powered conversational recipe discovery and nutrition analysis using Model Context Protocol (MCP)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 📖 Overview

AI Recipe & Nutrition Assistant is an intelligent **Model Context Protocol (MCP)** application built using the **NitroStack MCP Framework**.

It enables AI assistants to answer food-related questions by combining a comprehensive recipe dataset with detailed nutritional information.

Instead of manually searching recipes or nutrition tables, users simply ask questions naturally.

### Example Queries

```text
Show me high-protein breakfast recipes.

How many calories are in boiled eggs?

Find vegetarian recipes.

Show foods rich in fiber.
```

The AI understands the request, invokes the appropriate MCP tools, retrieves structured information, and returns personalized responses.

