--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ❗ Problem Statement

Finding healthy recipes and understanding nutritional values often requires switching between multiple websites and nutrition databases.

Current solutions are fragmented and lack conversational AI capabilities.

Users struggle to:

- Search recipes efficiently
- Compare nutritional values
- Find foods based on calories or nutrients
- Discover recipes matching dietary preferences
- Access structured nutrition information quickly

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 💡 Solution

The AI Recipe & Nutrition Assistant integrates recipe and nutrition datasets into a single AI-powered conversational MCP application.

The system:

- Understands natural language queries
- Searches recipe datasets
- Searches nutrition datasets
- Retrieves structured nutritional information
- Generates contextual recommendations
- Makes food discovery conversational

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 🤖 Agent Workflow

```text
                User
                  │
                  ▼
      NitroStack MCP Server
                  │
                  ▼
              AI Agent
                  │
        ┌─────────┴─────────┐
        ▼                   ▼
  Recipe Tools       Nutrition Tools
        │                   │
        ▼                   ▼
 Recipe Service     Nutrition Service
        │                   │
        ▼                   ▼
   Recipe CSV       Nutrition CSV
        └─────────┬─────────┘
                  ▼
     Structured AI Response
                  │
                  ▼
                User
```
