# 🔧 MCP Capabilities

The application exposes intelligent tools through the **Model Context Protocol (MCP)**.

| Capability                    | Description                    |
|------------------------------ |------------------------------- |
| 🍽️ Recipe Discovery          | Search recipes                 |
| 🥗 Nutrition Retrieval       | Nutrition lookup               |
| 🧂 Ingredient Search         | Find recipes using ingredients |
| 🥬 Food Category Search      | Browse food categories         |
| ❤️ Healthy Food Suggestions  | AI-powered recommendations     |
| 📂 Structured Dataset Access | Retrieve CSV data              |
| 🤖 MCP Tool Invocation       | Automatic AI tool calling      |

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 🛠️ MCP Tools

## 🍽️ Recipe Module

| Tool                 | Description                               |
|----------------------|-------------------------------------------|
| `search_recipe`      | Search recipes by name                    |
| `search_ingredient`  | Search recipes using one ingredient       |
| `search_ingredients` | Search recipes using multiple ingredients |
| `get_recipe`         | Retrieve a recipe by ID                   |
| `get_all_recipes`    | List all recipes                          |
| `random_recipe`      | Retrieve a random recipe                  |
| `top_recipes`        | Retrieve top-rated recipes                |

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 🥗 Nutrition Module

| Tool                | Description                      |
|---------------------|----------------------------------|
| `nutrition_info`    | Retrieve nutritional information |
| `search_food`       | Search foods by keyword          |
| `get_all_foods`     | Retrieve all food records        |
| `foods_by_category` | Retrieve foods by category       |

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 📂 MCP Resources

## 🍽️ Recipe Dataset

Contains:

- Recipe Name
- Ingredients
- Instructions
- Cuisine
- Preparation Time
- Cooking Time
- Servings

---

## 🥗 Nutrition Dataset

Contains:

- Food Name
- Measure
- Weight (g)
- Calories
- Protein
- Fat
- Saturated Fat
- Fiber
- Carbohydrates
- Food Category

