# 💬 Example Conversation

### User

```text
Show me high-protein vegetarian breakfast recipes.
```

### Assistant

```text
Here are three high-protein vegetarian breakfast recipes:

🥣 Greek Yogurt Parfait
🍳 Spinach Paneer Omelette
🥜 Peanut Butter Overnight Oats

Average Protein:
18–25 g

Calories:
280–420 kcal
```

