# 🚀 Why MCP?

Model Context Protocol enables AI assistants to communicate with external tools and datasets seamlessly.

### Benefits

- Intelligent tool selection
- Structured responses
- Better reasoning
- Modular architecture
- Scalable integrations
- Easy extensibility

